+        | Walk the dog | false     |
+        | Clean house  | false     |
+      When the user notes all 3 DOM nodes in the list
+      When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+      Then the tracked DOM nodes are still the same elements
+      And all todos are completed
+
+    Scenario: Unmarking all keeps every DOM node alive
