+        | Buy milk     | false     |
+        | Walk the dog | false     |
+      When the user notes the first DOM node in the list
+      When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+      Then the tracked DOM node is still the same element
+      When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
